something that can speak is anything with:
    way to speak.
a dog has a name (text).
a cat has a name (text).
a shape is one of:
    a parrot with words (text).
a dog can speak:
    say "Woof".
a cat can speak:
    say "Meow".
a shape can speak:
    say "Hello".
let pets be a list of a new dog with name "Rex", a new cat with name "Tom" and a new parrot with words "hi".
for each pet in pets:
    speak pet.
add a new dog with name "Fido" to the end of pets.
say the number of items in pets.
